 sections+=['# Week 0 — Integrated Analysis','','## What changed during this week?','','Dataset recall characterization → attempted generic model diagnostics (mock exports, not empirical) → real ten-query sensitivity probe → approximately length-controlled replacement → 40-paper sensitivity study. The later Week3 oracle join is retrospective and does not establish what was known initially. This sequence is supported by scripts and execution artifacts; exact intent or causal motivation beyond the recorded tests is not inferred.','','## Main supported findings','',table(pd.DataFrame([dict(finding='Top-10 any/all recall = 0.870130 / 0.800866',evidence='A: query-level retrieval CSV',strength='descriptive'),dict(finding='Generic model diagnostics exactly reproduce mock formulas',evidence='B/C: CSV + seeded source formulas',strength='strong provenance contradiction'),dict(finding='Pilot and final40 intervention signs differ',evidence='GPU-PILOT / FINAL40 raw CSVs',strength='descriptive; different samples'),dict(finding='STRONG match has higher final40 replacement delta',evidence='FINAL40 raw CSV + new paper bootstrap',strength='moderate exploratory association')])),'','## Negative / null findings','','The pilot has negative removal/replacement means; 146 final40 replacements are negative. Mock correlations cannot establish model behavior. No valid attention-as-causal-explanation result is established. The bridge establishes no deployable policy.','','## What remained unresolved?','','Identity/provenance cleanup of generic mock artifacts; intervention prompt sensitivity; imperfect gold mapping; generalization beyond the deliberately selected dev sample; generated answer-quality gains; prospective prediction of needed context. The stale generic pending status must not overwrite the separate final40 execution metadata.','','## What logically motivated the next week?','','The available later Week2 fixed-k notebook and Week3 oracle CSVs operationalize tests of answer quality versus context budget. Week1 primary experiment evidence was not located in the initial discovery. An explicit Week0-to-Week1 experimental decision is not established from available primary artifacts.','','# Primary Sources Used','']+['- '+link(z) for z in sorted(sources)]+['','# Existing Markdown Used as Evidence','','NONE','']
